And because QRL 2.0 derives substantial infrastructure from Ethereum—`go-qrl` from geth and `qrysm` from Prysm—you learn Ethereum internals simultaneously. QRL 2.0 is currently Testnet V2 and undergoing external audits before mainnet. ([QRL][4])

One annoyance given your earlier KYC comment: the bounty says rewards require proof of identity for legal compliance. ([QRL][1])

