# QRL therefore needs a second moat

This is what I would focus on if developing there.

Its future cannot just be:

> **“We're Ethereum but quantum-safe.”**

Because Ethereum intends to become Ethereum but quantum-safe.

QRL needs to own something like:

### The quantum-native security ecosystem.

For example:

```text
PQ wallets
PQ agent identity
quantum-safe machine payments
PQ multisig
PQ HSM integrations
Q-Day migration tooling
cross-chain PQ recovery
cryptographic inventory scanners
PQ provenance
quantum-safe enterprise custody
